 "title": "The First Machinima Movie",
 "cat": "technology",
 "emoji": "🎮",
 "sentences": [
  "The world's first machinima film was made inside Quake.",
  "Released in 1996, this short film was created by a gaming clan called the Rangers.",
  "It was distributed online as a non-interactive game demo file.",
  "The story features five players battling a lone camper in a deathmatch.",
  "Unlike earlier gameplay recordings, this was the first to use a narrative.",
  "It proved video games could be used for filmmaking."
